ive points, including surveys from Republican-leaning sponsors; the latest Marquette University poll showed a three-point lead among likely voters. Outside raters split between Tossup and Lean Democratic.\n\nTiffany holds a large financial edge, outraising Crowley by roughly ten to one, and Republicans have pressed an attack over COVID-era grants tied to a nonprofit employing Crowley's wife. Crowley has countered with a 40-city bus tour and positions such as repealing the data-center sales tax exemption, while Tiffany has kept his distance from Trump and pitched tax cuts. Betting markets price Crowley near 80 percent, but the race remains competitive and tilts Democratic.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7127, "margin": 2.83}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7543, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7549, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7725, "margin": 3.8}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.7589, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7208, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.724, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7645, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.7536, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7419, "margin": 3.2}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.746, "margin": 3.2}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.7525, "margin": 3.2}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.7388, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6631, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6796, "margin": 2.7}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6642, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.7316, "margin": 3.2}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.696, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.7094, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.7399, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7761, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.7443, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.7389, "margin": 3.3}, {"date": "2026-10-1